  "description_html": "The <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maastrichtian\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Maastrichtian\">Maastrichtian</a>, Transylvanian giant azhdarchid pterosaur <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hatzegopteryx\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Hatzegopteryx\">Hatzegopteryx</a> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Species\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Species\">sp.</a> preys on the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rhabdodontidae\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Rhabdodontidae\">rhabdodontid iguanodontian Zalmoxes</a>. Because large predatory theropods are unknown on Late Cretaceous Haţeg Island, giant <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Azhdarchidae\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Azhdarchidae\">azhdarchids</a> may have played a key role as terrestrial predators in this community.",
